{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Story</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/87ac9f9957eaddb70c930b85ceff8f4f.avif?t=1773833756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras_big/87ac9f9957eaddb70c930b85ceff8f4f.avif?t=1773833756 width=800 height=138 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/4789192a2fb6ea588ebc49790ceb0164.poster.avif?t=1773833756\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/4789192a2fb6ea588ebc49790ceb0164.webm?t=1773833756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a model prisoner taking care of 'security risks' in hell. Your daily routine is simple. Guide a new prisoner, and take them into a cell. While living that boring life, you finally make a decision. To escape to purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But you step into a forbidden room by mistake.\u00a0</strong>In that room, the most dangerous prisoners, called the 'Flowers', are incarcerated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now choose. Either take their hand and escape to purgatory, or close the door as if nothing has ever happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/0ff6a057f033a4df26529146b60abf88.avif?t=1773833756\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras_big/0ff6a057f033a4df26529146b60abf88.avif?t=1773833756 width=800 height=138 /></span><strong>Game features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Search: Look for clues in a cell reenacting each character's most painful times. Peek into their past, and maybe you can find a hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Conversation and choices: You can talk to characters, listen to their stories and grant their requests, or refuse with cruelty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Endings: There are five different endings. Choose a character, and face the destiny together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/98488e96c4008ac37e17918eb32befa8.poster.avif?t=1773833756\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/98488e96c4008ac37e17918eb32befa8.webm?t=1773833756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540550/extras/98488e96c4008ac37e17918eb32befa8.mp4?t=1773833756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>We will see you at the purgatory.</strong></i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Poison Ivy Rhapsody","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540550/2358351e17923c6629209f7ee07dbc8489980822.jpg"},{"name":"Imperfect Creation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540550/2eab48bc976bbf9c16ddc1b27c091837193b51e8.jpg"},{"name":"Necessary Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540550/aca136208c53f9c3f5190fb8cd10c56f6f651a57.jpg"},{"name":"A Star is Born","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3540550/edbff3d8b88b006a14fa24f53384a17275c3bc2e.jpg"},{"name":"Paradoc of Materia